{"name":"Northwind","hex":"#cee5e9","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"northwind","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of north wind."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/northwind"}],"entries":[{"title":"Northwind (company)","blocks":[{"text":"Northwind is a privately held company that develops property management systems, as well as GDS/web based booking products for the hospitality industry. Maestro Enterprise Suite, the company's flagship product, includes a variety of modules which can be co-ordinated to comply with a hotel or hotel chain's requirements. Maestro is a multi-platform system with over 10,000 users. It allows optimized adaptability to single or multi-property businesses. Northwind's headquarters are in Markham, Ontario, with sales and support offices located worldwide."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg/330px-NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northwind_(company)"},{"title":"Northwind (character)","blocks":[{"text":"Northwind is a fictional character appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/31/New_northwind.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Northwind_(character)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg/500px-NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg/1280px-NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/34/NorthwindMaestroMarkham.jpg/500px-NorthwindMaest